<title>TUNISIA: TUNISIA DETAILS CEREALS IMPORTS IN 1996.</title>
<headline>TUNISIA DETAILS CEREALS IMPORTS IN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's cereals imports were mostly down sharply in 1996 thanks to better weather, figures published by the National Statistics Institute showed.</p>
<p>Details:</p>
<p>		Quantity (tonnes)	  Value(million dinars)</p>
<p>		1996     1995     change  1996    1995    change</p>
<p> Soft wheat 663,800 910,600   -27.1%  131.5   147.1   -10.6%</p>
<p> Hard wheat 205,900 668,000   -69.2%   53.5   137.9   -61.2%</p>
<p> Barley	29,100 668,700   -95.6%    4.6    75.2   -95.6%</p>
<p> Maize	315,200 310,800    +1.4%   58.1    42.7   +36.1%</p>
<p>($=1.168 dinar)</p>
<p>--Tunis newsroom +2161-787538</p>
</text>
